ing even more variety to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find everything from traditional weapons like axes and shotguns to wackier ones like magic ponies and homing mother\u2019s slippers, making combat both chaotic and fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/a522a9f90c96fd2b367e1b8b3d766317.avif?t=1748974120\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/2e708eac454e0d72b479b48cb87dc92f.poster.avif?t=1748974120\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/2e708eac454e0d72b479b48cb87dc92f.webm?t=1748974120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/2e708eac454e0d72b479b48cb87dc92f.mp4?t=1748974120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/f891ac9c8d481d8535f50e27d3dd147d.avif?t=1748974120\" data-has-big width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/118c2e5c184289af1728859c16627abb.avif?t=1748974120\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be over<strong> 300</strong> different items across multiple tiers: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around <strong>20</strong> primary stats and over <strong>20</st