you start running, carrying this small and adorable robot. Luckily, it starts helping you fight off the enemies, and now you have no choice but to team up with it to face the invasion and return to your peaceful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/09aea00264743424554898146f348b31.avif?t=1748974120\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
